    DURCHS -->|Nein| KAB{"Kammer lehnt Annahme ab<br/>— <a href='{{ELI}}#art-z93b' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>§93b S.1</a><br/>(nur einstimmig)<br/>— <a href='{{ELI}}#art-z93d_abs-z3' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>§93d III</a>"}

